 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Come on, find a spot you can sit indoors and enjoy the sun. Wasps need dirt to build a working nest, and they' leave you alone once they' built it. Then act friendly and follow them. Wasps are drawn to sweet and strong smells, so keep food out of sight and wash dishes soon after eating. It deters useful bees and other wasps, so it' worth trying. If you do find a wasp nest, don't try to get rid of it yourself. Sadly, even a fake wasp nest can trigger a real one to leave. Best to leave it to the professionals.",
